OL,3,GNEWSAMeal price hike 'taking food out'
OL,4,Aof kids' mouths
OL,5,
OL,6,FAngie Comerford, co-founder of Hebburn
OL,7,FHelps, said: "There's no provision to
OL,8,Fhelp out with people on a low income,
OL,9,Fwe see that in the food bank every
OL,10,Fday."
